WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.852
Borel fails in dimension four.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.294
Colour a cycle red and blue, neighbours

3
00:00:05.294 --> 00:00:07.432
different. An odd cycle always clashes.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:13.079
A homeomorphism would force a clean colouring of an odd cycle. Impossible.

5
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:17.355
Claimed: same homotopy type, yet not homeomorphic.

6
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:18.644
Not in Lean.
